Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentNumber": "40110005",
  "firstName": "Mina",
  "lastName": "Test",
  "isMale": false,
  "grade": -2.0,
  "dateOfBirth": "2005-01-01T00:00:00",
  "leftUnitsCount": 10
}

### 10. Get student by StudentNumber (PostgreSQL)
GET http://localhost:5239/api/students/40110001?db=postgres

### 11. Get student by StudentNumber (SQL Server)
GET http://localhost:5239/api/students/40110002?db=sqlserver

